      "content": "That feeling of helplessness is incredibly heavy to carry, and it's okay to feel like the pieces of your life are just unraveling. Often, even when things feel like they are completely ending, there is value in the process of letting go and creating a new space for hope. If you feel too overwhelmed to be alone, please consider reaching out to a trusted friend or a mental health professional who can offer support to help you navigate through this darkness.",
