      "content": "Your desire to end the pain before it becomes unendable is a cry for relief that is too heavy for anyone to handle alone. I hope you would consider that the peace you seek might be found in the knowledge that you do not have to finish this suffering by yourself. Please, I urge you to call the 988 Suicide and Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 988 right now to talk to someone who can help you explore these feelings in the safety of a life we encourage you to stay.",
